      "snippet": "\tprofile.Data.Cash -= bet -- expect: luau-shield001",
      "title": "Client-controlled value written to currency, stats or saved data",
      "why": "Exploiters can fire any remote with any arguments. If the server adds a client-supplied amount to a currency, saves a client-supplied table or lets the client pick the DataStore key, an exploiter can give themselves unlimited currency, corrupt other players' data or poison saves with NaN/huge values. Luau type annotations are erased at runtime: they do not validate anything."
